POST /setup   → enrol user, return QR + secret
POST /verify  → check OTP at every login</pre>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="term dbterm">
        <div class="term-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>sync_lab.exe</span></div>
